  "question": {
    "html": "<p>An engine is exerting a horizontal force <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> on an object that is moving along a horizontal surface at a constant velocity <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span>. The mass of the object is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> and the coefficient of dynamic friction between the object and the surface is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"μ\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the power of the engine?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Fv}{μ}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"μFv\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mgv}{μ}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"μmgv\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
